  "description": "The System.Drawing API rewritten from scratch in managed .NET: runs on Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, iOS,\n        in containers and in the browser (WebAssembly), with no GDI+, libgdiplus or native library. The foundation of\n        WinForms-NT and WPF-NT, and used by Wisej.NET.\n        Clean room, faster than GDI+ and SkiaSharp in most workloads, thread-safe, with built-in\n        SVG, WMF/EMF and all common image formats.\n        Bundled fallback fonts: Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License 1.1), metric compatible with Arial.",
